Terse keywords
description: yaml-style short names, probably kebab-cased - TBD
- >
  JSON Schema's keywords are verbose and camel-cased (`additionalProperties`, `minItems`,
  `uniqueItems`). Yamlover meta keywords will be **YAML-style short** - the tradition of `set`,
  `omap`, `int` - and probably **kebab-cased**. The exact spellings are TBD; until they land, the
  JSON Schema spellings remain the working vocabulary, and the
  [equivalence table](::meta:vs-json-schema) tracks each keyword's fate.
